codex.netheryx.page.1=NetheryX Codex\n\nA traveller's guide to the new Nether: biomes, creatures, structures, guardians and the Nether Heart.\n\nRead on, and good luck.
codex.netheryx.page.2=BIOMES\n\nTwelve biomes now share the Nether: Ember Meadow and Grove, Ashen Wastes, Sulfur Springs, Soulfire Marsh, Withered Forest, Magma Rift, Marrow Thicket, Rimefrost Chasm, Wartvine Tangle, Quartz Reef, Petrified Forest.
codex.netheryx.page.3=MATERIALS\n\nOnyx (ore below Y 60) beats diamond. Sulfur makes gunpowder, bombs and fire charges. Rich quartz ore gives double quartz. Soul sand smelts into soul dust.
codex.netheryx.page.4=FARMING\n\nBlaze peppers, cinder wheat and soul tubers grow on soul sand without light. Fire berries grow on bushes. Ember cows, cinder hens and blaze pigs live in the warm biomes.
codex.netheryx.page.5=CREATURES\n\nBeware of Ember Stalkers, Ash Wraiths, Withered Knights, Fire Ghasts, Onyx Cubes, Basalt Burrowers and Mimics hiding as chests. Piglin Merchants trade useful goods for gold and onyx.
codex.netheryx.page.6=COMPANIONS\n\nLantern Bearers (glowcap) light your way. Cinder Lizards (fire berries) can be saddled and ridden: their rider resists fire.
codex.netheryx.page.7=STRUCTURES\n\nCamps, gardens, caravans and hidden caches hold loot. The Soul Compass points to the nearest one you have discovered (sneak to change the type).
codex.netheryx.page.8=DUNGEONS\n\nThe Onyx Citadel, the Infernal Sanctum, the Withered Catacombs and the Basalt Forge each hide a guardian. Its vault is sealed with warded bricks: they break when the guardian falls.
codex.netheryx.page.9=GUARDIANS\n\nOnyx Sentinel, Infernal Warlock, Withered Champion and Basalt Golem drop a trophy each. Combine the four trophies into the Sealed Heart.
codex.netheryx.page.10=THE NETHER HEART\n\nOpen the Sealed Heart in the Nether, in a large arena. The Heart flies, calls guards at 66% and 33% health and shields itself meanwhile. It never heals.
codex.netheryx.page.11=ENDGAME\n\nThe Heart drops abyssal shards, the abyssal upgrade template and an Ash Wyvern egg. Upgrade onyx armor with template + shard, or forge the Abyssal Blade.
codex.netheryx.page.12=WYVERN\n\nHatch the egg: your wyvern follows you, fights and can be ridden (look where you want to fly). The Wyvern Whistle calls it back; the Wyvern Crystal stores it.
codex.netheryx.page.13=SOUL ALTAR\n\nPlace an item and an offering, light two fires nearby, then press Infuse. Magma shells: Ember Stride (boots). Soul dust: Soul Harvest (weapons). Basalt carapace: Anchoring.
codex.netheryx.page.14=INFUSIONS\n\nCharge an onyx infusion template with magma cream (smelting), a burrower fang (celerity) or onyx (resilience), then combine it with a tool or armor at the anvil.
codex.netheryx.page.15=TRAVEL\n\nThe Recall Stone brings you back next to the last portal you took. The Glimmer Elixir grants night vision and fire resistance. Magma Treads crust lava under your feet.
